1
00:00:01,081 --> 00:00:02,496
This star died

2
00:00:02,546 --> 00:00:05,255
four thousand years ago.

3
00:00:05,820 --> 00:00:06,713
But she can

4
00:00:06,763 --> 00:00:08,505
still see it.

5
00:00:08,555 --> 00:00:09,511
Its light is

6
00:00:09,561 --> 00:00:11,486
still travelling…

7
00:00:11,536 --> 00:00:13,017
still arriving.

8
00:00:13,689 --> 00:00:14,994
Everything you see

9
00:00:15,044 --> 00:00:16,590
in the sky

10
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:17,575
is a goodbye

11
00:00:17,625 --> 00:00:19,500
that hasn't finished

12
00:00:19,550 --> 00:00:20,762
being said.

13
00:00:21,426 --> 00:00:23,643
She didn't know it…

14
00:00:23,693 --> 00:00:25,164
but she was doing

15
00:00:25,214 --> 00:00:27,177
the same thing.

16
00:00:27,227 --> 00:00:28,353
Every kindness

17
00:00:28,403 --> 00:00:30,793
left her like light.

18
00:00:30,843 --> 00:00:32,162
Slowly.

19
00:00:32,212 --> 00:00:33,254
Quietly.

20
00:00:34,519 --> 00:00:36,013
One night,

21
00:00:36,063 --> 00:00:38,827
her light went out.

22
00:00:41,243 --> 00:00:42,294
But it didn't

23
00:00:42,344 --> 00:00:44,079
stop arriving.

24
00:00:44,129 --> 00:00:46,303
It's still reaching

25
00:00:46,353 --> 00:00:48,388
people she never met.

26
00:00:48,828 --> 00:00:50,563
So maybe the question

27
00:00:50,613 --> 00:00:52,193
isn't how long

28
00:00:52,243 --> 00:00:53,844
you shine…

29
00:00:53,894 --> 00:00:54,874
but how far

30
00:00:54,924 --> 00:00:57,583
your light travels after.

